		(property "Design Notes" "One of three paralleled 220 uF polymer reservoirs (660 uF total, effective ESR ~8 mOhm) sourcing the BG95 TX burst locally at the Mini PCIe socket - sizing math in docs/power-support-circuit.md (target effective ESR <= 10 mOhm). Layout: wide pour to J5 VCC pins 2/39/41/52, each cap on its own via pairs into the power and ground planes, ground return into the plane at the socket GND pins - a 10 mm routed trace would double the effective ESR. Verify at order: ESR spec at 100 kHz, ripple rating covers the 2.7 A burst, and voltage derating at 3.3 V."
			(at 0 0 90)
			(unlocked yes)
			(layer "F.Fab")
			(hide yes)
