		(property "Design Notes" "ESD clamp for the four user-accessible SIM lines (VDD/IO/CLK/RST). Quectel 3.3 requires a TVS array with parasitic capacitance <= 15 pF at the holder; this part is ~3 pF/channel (SOT-23-6, same family as U6). Rail-clamp: VBUS (pin 5) to SIM_VDD, I/O1-4 to VDD/DATA/CLK/RST, GND via next to pin 2. Place at the holder, not the socket."
			(at 0 0 180)
			(unlocked yes)
			(layer "F.Fab")
			(hide yes)
			(uuid "b6b474d6-75e6-474f-884a-caddad408016")
