		(property "Design Notes" "With R56 forms a divider from 3V3_CELL giving ~1.65 V on SIM_DET when no card is present - inside the 1.2-2.0 V VIH window of the 1.8 V domain (Table 23). The Mini PCIe card exports no always-on 1.8 V rail, so Fig 4's 51k pull-up to 1.8 V is synthesised this way; pulling up to USIM_VDD instead would float the detect level whenever the modem powers the SIM rail down."
			(at 0 0 0)
			(unlocked yes)
			(layer "F.Fab")
