		(property "Design Notes" "Shield-to-GND RC, parallel with R25. 2 kV rating required so an ESD hit on the connector shell does not punch through to GND; no 0402/0603 automotive part meets 2 kV, hence the 1206 body (plan originally targeted 0603 - deviation accepted for the voltage rating)."
