		(property "Design Notes" "Feed all four VCC_3V3 pins (2, 39, 41, 52) from 3V3_CELL and all fourteen GND pins to the plane. RESERVED pins stay unconnected (Table 4 note 3) - never grounded. UART is 3.3 V at this connector, no level shifting. Card RX (pin 11) wires to PIC TX; card TX (pin 13) to PIC RX - names are card-relative, do not cross twice."
