		(property "Design Notes" "ESD protection at the antenna connector, required by Integration manual 4.5.2. Capacitance is the selection criterion on a 1575 MHz line: 0.25 pF typ with a flat response past 3.4 GHz, so it does not detune RF_IN the way a general-purpose TVS would. Bidirectional, and the 14 V standoff sits clear of the 3.3 V VCC_RF bias when an active antenna is fitted. Mount it hard against J3 with the shortest possible ground return - RF_IN itself must stay stub-free (IM 4.8.4.1)."
			(at 0 0 180)
			(unlocked yes)
			(layer "F.Fab")
			(hide yes)
			(uuid "279ba6e2-0cbc-4a2f-92b5-3bdff6942645")
			(effects
